    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是之前在屋頂這裡告訴我\n摔角鷹人狀況的人，對不對？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F4E4B524D57285C4B9802901988E1544A8A346211000A645489D29DF94EBA72C06CC176844EBAFF0C5C0D4E0D5C0DFF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳是那位會餵牠東西的人",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B3662F90A34F4D6703993572606771897F76844EBA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然沒錯！在那之後，\n我順利遇見摔角鷹人了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n牠是一副快要累垮的樣子就是了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C71366C92932FFF01572890A34E4B5F8CFF0C000A6211980652299047898B645489D29DF94EBA4E86FF0100100001BE00000A7260662F4E00526F5FEB89817D2F57AE76846A235B505C31662F4E86300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過……從那之後，\n摔角鷹人好像就有點奇怪。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E202620265F9E90A34E4B5F8CFF0C000A645489D29DF94EBA597D50CF5C3167099EDE5947602A300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠總是看著遙遠的地方，\n好像在回想著什麼似的……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72607E3D662F770B8457905990607684573065B9FF0C000A597D50CF572856DE60F384574EC09EBC4F3C76842026202600100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "摔呀！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64545440FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦！？\n摔角鷹人你怎麼了？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF01FF1F000A645489D29DF94EBA4F60600E9EBC4E86FF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來是一副要戰鬥的樣子呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F86662F4E00526F898162309B2576846A235B505462300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "摔呀！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64545440FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……難不成牠是想和<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳對戰？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202696E34E0D62107260662F60F3548C00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C0D6230FF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是想要一雪前恥吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F60F389814E0096EA524D606554270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為上次牠是失控狀態",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA4E0A6B217260662F593163A772C0614B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯？什麼？\n那是什麼意思？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF1F4EC09EBCFF1F000A90A3662F4EC09EBC610F601DFF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我不太清楚狀況，\n但為了實現摔角鷹人的願望，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和牠對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662114E0D592A6E05695A72C06CC1FF0C000A4F4670BA4E865BE673FE645489D29DF94EBA76849858671BFF0C00100001BE00000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C72605C0D62305427FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
