      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F8868D2768496EA60656230FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來寶可夢對戰……\n是這麼精彩呀！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F865BF653EF59225C0D623020262026000A662F90199EBC7CBE5F695440FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不在於擊潰對手，\n而是在於施展出自己的實力……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D572865BC64CA6F705C0D624BFF0C000A800C662F572865BC65BD5C5551FA81EA5DF176845BE6529B2026202600100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "摔角鷹人。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果你不嫌棄的話，\n讓我當你的搭檔好不好？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "645489D29DF94EBA300200100001BE01000A5982679C4F604E0D5ACC68C476848A71FF0C000A8B93621175764F607684642D6A94597D4E0D597DFF1F00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不會只是餵你吃東西，\n我還會學習該怎麼當個訓練家的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D670353EA662F99354F6054036771897FFF0C000A6211908467035B787FD28A72600E9EBC7576500B8A137DF45BB67684300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想成為你的幫手！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3621070BA4F6076845E6B624BFF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……摔呀！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202664545440FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就再次請你多多指教囉！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31518D6B218ACB4F60591A591A6307655956C9FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和摔角鷹人對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C645489D29DF94EBA5C0D6230FF0100100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我之前以為野生寶可夢\n要在城市裡生活可能並不容易，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但寶可夢真是強韌啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E4B524D4EE570BA91CE751F5BF653EF5922000A8981572857CE5E0288E1751F6D3B53EF80FD4E264E0D5BB96613FF0C00100001BE00000A4F465BF653EF5922771F662F5F3797CC554A300200100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也會努力的。我要讓自己能\n和摔角鷹人一起變得更強！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
